        "node_id": "n_2_0df228",
        "thought_text": "I apologize for the oversight. The issue in the previous implementation was that it didn't correctly handle the case where multiple passengers were equally close to a single seat. Let's modify the approach to ensure that all equally close passengers are considered together and either seated or exploded. This will resolve the problem and provide the correct count of explosions.",
